  "scope": "Ten dedicated introductory derivations, three browser-local continuous-group experiments, normalized superposition states and truthful lesson/preset/tool continuations. Existing high-dimensional tools and exercises remain available. Foundational demonstration, micro-experiment and theorem panels adapt to their actual available course width. English inline-math discovery keeps the prose conjunction nor outside adjacent group symbols; affected module imports have fresh cache versions.",
